{"id":"n88446-4-8","stage":4,"title":"휩싸이다 · 笼罩","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n88446-4-8-1","ko":"오늘 승규가 평소보다 많이 마시네.","zh":"今天承奎喝得比平时多啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"승규가","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"평소보다","meaning":"平常，平时，平日","explanation":"평소：平常，平时，平日；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"평소","audio":"/audio/ebf09ee6c46b848f6558.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71341","senseId":"1","lemma":"평소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마시네.","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"ebf09ee6c46b848f","term":"평소","zh":"平常，平时，平日","audio":"/audio/ebf09ee6c46b848f6558.mp3","entryId":"71341","definition":"没有特别事情，通常的时候。","pronunciation":["평소"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"dbfc687cbb29318d","term":"마시다","zh":"喝，饮","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3","entryId":"64682","definition":"使水等液体流入喉咙。","pronunciation":["마시다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8dd6755e1e81dbc70fb3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n88446-4-8-2","ko":"응. 술자리 분위기에 휩싸여서 그런 것 같아.","zh":"嗯，大概是被酒局的气氛带动了吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"술자리","meaning":"酒席，酒局","explanation":"술자리：酒席，酒局","readings":[{"term":"술자리","audio":"/audio/b101ac71541d7750e721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65373","senseId":"1","lemma":"술자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"분위기에","meaning":"气氛，氛围","explanation":"분위기：气氛，氛围；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"분위기","audio":"/audio/b0d7b29bb8fee6469928.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65855","senseId":"2","lemma":"분위기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"휩싸여서","meaning":"笼罩，充满，萦绕","explanation":"휩싸이다：笼罩，充满，萦绕；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"휩싸이다","audio":"/audio/66b5e7a1422b45d0e6f5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88446","senseId":"4","lemma":"휩싸이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그런","meaning":"那种，那样","explanation":"그런：那种，那样","readings":[{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60341","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"b101ac71541d7750","term":"술자리","zh":"酒席，酒局","audio":"/audio/b101ac71541d7750e721.mp3","entryId":"65373","definition":"喝酒的场合。","pronunciation":["술짜리"]},{"id":"b0d7b29bb8fee646","term":"분위기","zh":"气氛，氛围","audio":"/audio/b0d7b29bb8fee6469928.mp3","entryId":"65855","definition":"周围的状况或环境。","pronunciation":["부뉘기"]},{"id":"66b5e7a1422b45d0","term":"휩싸이다","zh":"笼罩，充满，萦绕","audio":"/audio/66b5e7a1422b45d0e6f5.mp3","entryId":"88446","definition":"氛围、沉默等包裹周围。","pronunciation":["휩싸이다"]},{"id":"d14f5bfb24390ed9","term":"그런","zh":"那种，那样","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3","entryId":"60341","definition":"状态、模样、性质等那个样子的。","pronunciation":["그런"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/71020bff05259abe1acd.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.542,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=88446","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"고급","day":127,"sequenceScore":2.3687,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，大概是被酒局的气氛带动了吧。","今天承奎喝得比平时多啊。","知道我们部门要来个靠关系空降的人吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天承奎喝得比平时多啊。","知道我们部门要来个靠关系空降的人吗？","嗯，大概是被酒局的气氛带动了吧。"],"answer":2}]}
